IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `dipops-compensation`

-- Deposit Insurance and Policy Owners' Protection Schemes Act 2011, ss 2, 5, 21-23, 26, 47-50A, 67, 70, 71 and First, Second and Fourth Schedules -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_deposit-insurance-and-policy-owners-protection-schemes-act-2011.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 5`

#ASSERT `the institution is a DI Scheme member` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the institution is a DI Scheme member` TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the institution is a DI Scheme member` FALSE TRUE FALSE

