#ASSERT `the depositor holds an insured deposit` `Singapore dollar SRS moneys` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the depositor holds an insured deposit` `a Singapore dollar savings account` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE

